## Match Your Scenario to a Package

Most small business AV needs fall into one of three shapes, and each maps to a real package rather than the biggest one in the catalog:

-   **Product demo or presentation**: the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes a sound system with mixing console, a wireless microphone, and a laser projector and screen, plus HDMI and USB-C adapters to connect your own laptop. No technician included, self-run.
-   **Informal workshop or small gathering**: the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers sound, a microphone and lighting for up to 50 guests, delivery only, no technician.
-   **Small client meeting or executive session**: the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers sound, a gooseneck microphone and a projector for up to 40 guests, with a technician available as an add on if you want one.

See live pricing and full inclusions for each on our [packages page](/packages/).

