## Projectors and Screens for a Small Business Budget

A projector and screen or a laser projector setup are usually all a small business presentation needs, not a video wall. Our [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes a laser projector and screen sized for a demo or presentation room, along with the adapters to connect your own laptop.

A few things worth checking before you book any provider's projector setup:

-   Confirm the room size and lighting so the projector is bright enough for the space.
-   Ask whether adapters for your laptop are included, so you are not scrambling for a cable on the day.
-   Ask whether setup and testing happen before you arrive, not after.

## Keeping Costs Down

A few real levers that keep a small business AV budget down without cutting corners on the event itself:

-   On the Eco Pack, skip the optional projector add on if your event does not need visuals.
-   On the Basic MICE Pack, skip the technician add on if someone on your team is comfortable running a single gooseneck microphone.
-   Match the package to your actual guest count rather than booking the next size up "just in case."

