## FAQs

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a small business event?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Eco Pack and Product Presentation Pack for a small event up to the MICE Pack for a full conference, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### Do I need an AV technician, or can I run the equipment myself?

Not always. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) and [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) are delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you, no technician required. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers a technician as an add on, and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes one. See [No In-House AV Team? Here's What We Handle](#no-in-house-av-team-heres-what-we-handle) above.

### Is it cheaper to rent or buy a sound system for a small business?

For a single event or occasional use, renting is generally more cost effective than buying, since it avoids the maintenance and storage costs of equipment you rarely use. Our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers sound, a microphone and lighting for a small event, delivered and collected for you.

### What AV equipment does a small business actually need for a product demo, workshop or client meeting?

It depends on the scenario: a product demo needs a sound system, a microphone and a projector for slides, which the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) covers. An informal workshop mainly needs sound and a microphone, which the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers. A small client meeting benefits from a projector, which the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers, with a technician available as an optional add on if you want one. See [Match Your Scenario to a Package](#match-your-scenario-to-a-package) above.

### How can I keep AV rental costs down for a small business event?

Match the package to your actual guest count, skip optional add ons your event does not need such as the projector on the Eco Pack or the technician on the Basic MICE Pack, and book the package sized for your scenario rather than the next one up. See [Keeping Costs Down](#keeping-costs-down) above.

### How far in advance should a small business book AV rental equipment?

Book as early as you can once your date and venue are confirmed, to guarantee the package and date you want. Contact us with your event details and we will confirm availability.
